OL,4,CThree charged with murder after man,   
OL,5,C27, stabbed                            
OL,6,GThree men have been charged with       
OL,7,Gmurdering a 27-year-old man who was    
OL,8,Gstabbed to death.                      
OL,10,FHe died in Moss Bank in Crumpsall,     
OL,11,FManchester, shortly after 01:30 GMT on 
OL,12,FSaturday.                              
OL,14,FHamza Nadeem, 25, and Hayder Nadeem,   
OL,15,F24, both of Galsworthy Avenue,         
OL,16,FCheetham Hill and 26-year-old Brendan  
OL,17,FVinter, of Kiwi Street, Salford, have  
OL,18,Fbeen charged over the attack.          
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
