OL,4,CLorry driver who hit pedestrian        
OL,5,Ctreated as witness                     
OL,6,GA lorry driver who fatally struck a    
OL,7,Gpedestrian on a motorway is now being  
OL,8,Gtreated as a witness, police have      
OL,9,Gconfirmed.                             
OL,11,FA man in his 40s died after being hit  
OL,12,Fby the HGV on the M55 near junction    
OL,13,Fone for Broughton on 11 November.      
OL,15,FThe lorry driver, a man, in his 30s,   
OL,16,Fwas arrested on suspicion of causing   
OL,17,Fdeath by dangerous driving and drug    
OL,18,Fdriving.                               
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
