OL,4,CPlans to demolish remains of           
OL,5,Chistorical bath house                  
OL,6,GPlans have been put forward to         
OL,7,Gdemolish what remains of a 19th        
OL,8,GCentury bath house in a town's         
OL,9,Gconservation area.                     
OL,11,FBritain's Energy Coast (BEC) West      
OL,12,FCumbria has applied to Cumberland      
OL,13,FCouncil for permission to knock down   
OL,14,FWhitehaven's Bath House, on the corner 
OL,15,Fof Duke Street and the harbour's       
OL,16,Fpromenade.                             
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
