OL,4,CWoman, 19, hit and killed by car       
OL,5,Coutside hospital                       
OL,6,GA 19-year-old woman has died after     
OL,7,Gbeing hit by a car outside a           
OL,8,GMerseyside hospital.                   
OL,10,FShe was struck near the accident and   
OL,11,Femergency department of Arrowe Park    
OL,12,FHospital, Wirral, on Tuesday at 22:25  
OL,13,FGMT, police said.                      
OL,15,FThe woman, who is from the Wirral      
OL,16,Farea, was treated by hospital staff    
OL,17,Fbut died at the scene, Merseyside      
OL,18,FPolice said. Her next of kin have been 
OL,19,Finformed.                              
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
